Third-party attribution
=======================

Wallfinder concept and selector UI
----------------------------------

Synx Shell's wallfinder was inspired by gustahxn's Wallfinder project:
https://github.com/gustahxn/wallfinder

The upstream project is a Wayland wallpaper selector built around fzf,
chafa, and swaybg. Synx Shell uses its own implementation and logic for X11
and bspwm: it applies images with feh, previews them with ueberzugpp (with
chafa as a fallback), sorts and selects local wallpapers, and integrates
Matugen-generated colors with Synx Shell's runtime theme files and bspwm
borders. No upstream source code is included in Synx Shell's wallfinder.

